    {
      "text": "HELP US SPREAD THE WORD!\nRidgeline Roofing Ltd are looking for a quality roofer to join the team.\nIf you know someone who takes pride in their work and knows their way around a roof, give this post a share or tag them below!\n See less\n\nWhen we say we’re switching it up… we mean it.",
